{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_title", "source_sha256": "62c7a1eaec79613f17ac54f21831961e1b605fe0072a52eab22330f546662a6f", "ja": "ある晴れた日の歌声", "zh": "某个晴天的歌声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_synopsis", "source_sha256": "36aa4a31a9b2c4bec22cb206923c0eb0e30a9c5195eaa253b7372dece4c4bd80", "ja": "センターを務めることになった歌織。\nこれまでの合唱の舞台とは違うステージに\n戸惑う彼女だったが、莉緒や亜利沙たちと\nの交流の中で、アイドルになることの意味\nに触れ、仲間と共に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "歌织即将担任Center。\n面对不同于过去合唱团表演的演出，\n她感到有些迷惘。但在和莉绪及亚利沙的\n互动中，歌织渐渐了解何谓偶像，\n并和伙伴们一起顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7522fef3edc981664bd0b050ead4b74726d714c14c8864ef9812149ecd5c7fc0", "ja": "歌織さん！\nここにいたんですね。", "zh": "歌织小姐！\n你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "411a7d7de05eeafea1a30b3bb877733b0a7501be7d800222492f60ce34bbadb1", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\nどうなさいました？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "80f07ce07d74ef229a58edc0e214dae5009c66ac40e495780fad2f505f91aaf9", "ja": "ちょっと、{$P$}くん。\n私もいるんだけど？", "zh": "等一下，{$P$}。\n我也在这喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "11f846596fc35a7a0fd6230d58e9a7298e49239f113aaa7903a12f243c8c85b1", "ja": "ご、ごめんごめん。別に無視したわけじゃないんだ。\nただ、歌織さんに話があって……。", "zh": "抱、抱歉，我不是有意要无视你。\n只是正好有事要跟歌织小姐说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e6def7e971497f65eb509e7a90a05b5721d425ec56fc433d6928a9308755815a", "ja": "歌織さん、次の公演のセンターを\nやってもらえないですか？", "zh": "歌织小姐，\n能请你担任下次公演的Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "7ca9c901745af346d1a2275c1a48a1213f906b5c0b5edc6953346bb7dbda4fbc", "ja": "えっ？\nセンターって……わ、私が、センターを……！？", "zh": "咦？\nCenter……我、我来担任Center吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "004e854c2087d45556beda4d248b4dd9bdcba48588a3bdc8794de61aa2fd64db", "ja": "あら、すごいじゃない歌織ちゃん！　おめでとう！\n今日はお祝いしなくちゃね♪", "zh": "哎呀，真是个好消息呢，小歌！\n恭喜你！今天得庆祝一下才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "4e7f1ae58edcc043a2eb1fd906649e74aa1fab6db9638e159439ca57afb5b39e", "ja": "なんと～！？\n歌織さん、おめでとうございますっ！", "zh": "什么～！？\n歌织姊，恭喜你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "7dd4b0de60daa139fc976ae0ff6340ff6e81dd29b3fd7aa5bd6fe09d9a8cbe2a", "ja": "ありさにも、いっぱいお祝いさせてください～！", "zh": "也请务必让亚利沙替你大大地庆祝一番～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "93816637d251d7f4815c5ac52b3bdf2a57ea846f17edeebf7e07732369426770", "ja": "たまきもお祝いするぞ！\nかおり、おめでと～！", "zh": "环也会帮你庆祝喔！\n歌织，恭喜你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "5f1d1b3274648922ec316b40c86e9eea87f335b560ba5417284038858db965dc", "ja": "歌織さんのコトは、知る人ぞ知る自衛隊の歌姫として、\nありさもその噂を耳にしていました……。", "zh": "关于歌织姊是「自卫队的歌姬」这个\n内行人才知道的风声，亚利沙也略有耳闻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "efbc068efbdd63b090242fc4402ae743a0ed0601c0bbfcc677e0beeb0b3ec4ad", "ja": "それがまさか同じ765プロの劇場で、アイドルとして\n一緒に活動できるなんて……ありさ、感無量ですーっ！", "zh": "但万万没想到能在765艺能的剧场里，\n以偶像身分一起活动……亚利沙真是感动万分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "891a9344ab1932ea3f8a0c8d5f2574125fd135cc314d75559ec54fdeda396eae", "ja": "そんな歌織さんの初センターライブを、かぶりつきで\n見られ……コホンッ。ご一緒できるなんて、光栄です！", "zh": "竟然有机会在这么近的距离观赏……咳咳，\n参与歌织姊首次担任Center的演唱会，真是太荣幸了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef7e77dd955ad4fe5ae057274bd995c01ea733b6dbd025eb9d1261d258a2b9f4", "ja": "ありがとう。私も亜利沙ちゃんたちと\n同じ舞台に立てるなんて、とってもうれしい。", "zh": "谢谢你，能和亚利沙你们同台表演，\n我也觉得很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9480359d151dfab40c585deedf3c7abe63b9d472712d88a784ae106b8df298ee", "ja": "歌織さん、それじゃあ……！", "zh": "歌织小姐，你是说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "2ea812fb5732214ea695d2c363fd1cc7d896991f84e041ae8f97dcbf8cafb995", "ja": "はい。まだアイドルとして、未熟なところばかりですが\n……このお話、引き受けさせてください。", "zh": "是的。虽然在偶像这方面，\n我还有很多需要学习的地方……但我很乐意接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "015582ceac2e629824f4664b4162dc6c269f3562465f1c4da44b45eb70363815", "ja": "すごいわね、歌織ちゃん。\nセンターに選ばれたのに、緊張しないの？", "zh": "小歌，你好厉害唷。\n被选为Center，你都不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "c3decad4c24ace48081bc2d05f56d722b541bfd500134cdf9d4e941bf757b089", "ja": "してないわけじゃないけど……小さい頃から合唱団に\n入っていたから、舞台に立つことには慣れているかも。", "zh": "倒也不是不会紧张……可能是因为我从小就参加过\n合唱团，很习惯上台表演的缘故吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "92da91d9450c7f5aceaecaec9343bda704c85e4d587c12f2ff27ebd9c6033a3b", "ja": "おお～。\nなんだか、かおりカッコイイー！", "zh": "哦哦～\n总觉得歌织好帅气──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "be71c05c4295d392527465189efc93992748ef59b6902b65ab9b3ef2e69e5589", "ja": "これは、すごいステージになりそうですよ～！\nカメラの準備をしておかないと……ムフフ♪", "zh": "看来会是场很精彩的表演呢～！\n得准备好相机才行……唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_005_1020_p", "source_sha256": "172c2307e041555f078da163707fc6702b376807e802d9e40077a840980c2486", "ja": "（確かに堂々としてて頼もしく見える！\nどんなステージになるか、今から楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（歌织小姐胸有成竹的模样，看起来真可靠！\n我已经开始期待会呈现出什么样的表演了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
